WEBVTT

01:36.560 --> 01:41.050
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.350 --> 01:43.920
[Episode 22]

01:46.280 --> 01:48.340
The Fire King still failed in the end.

01:48.759 --> 01:51.080
Li Chenzhou, Liu Suifeng,

01:51.680 --> 01:53.080
you two are not half bad.

01:54.440 --> 01:55.440
But unfortunately,

01:55.440 --> 01:57.039
it is all too late.

01:57.160 --> 01:59.289
The martial world is already in chaos.

01:59.759 --> 02:02.320
I've made proper arrangements
for the Northern Wasteland.

02:02.320 --> 02:05.200
Everything is under my control.

02:06.120 --> 02:08.199
However resourceful you are,

02:08.560 --> 02:12.160
you'll never figure out why I can
always get one step ahead of you.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.750
[Liang Residence]

02:48.200 --> 02:48.930
Big Brother?

02:49.040 --> 02:50.970
Big Brother, you're finally back.

02:52.720 --> 02:53.650
Just now, you...

02:54.800 --> 02:57.280
You've regained all your martial strength!

02:57.600 --> 02:58.329
Big Brother!

02:59.120 --> 02:59.920
Are you okay?

03:01.240 --> 03:02.770
If you had hit me any harder,

03:02.920 --> 03:04.320
I wouldn't be okay at all.

03:05.160 --> 03:05.640
Yuhan,

03:07.040 --> 03:09.880
Big Brother's meridians
have truly fully recovered.

03:09.880 --> 03:12.320
Even his internal energy
has increased significantly.

03:12.320 --> 03:13.120
This is great.

03:17.560 --> 03:18.240
Guys,

03:19.200 --> 03:20.130
thank you so much

03:21.800 --> 03:23.800
for taking care of me in recent days.

03:25.160 --> 03:28.360
I have finally returned from the dead.

03:31.040 --> 03:32.040
Enough chitchat.

03:32.680 --> 03:33.640
Where is

03:35.680 --> 03:36.810
Grand Master Dayin?

03:38.720 --> 03:39.520
Mr. Liang,

03:39.960 --> 03:41.090
Grand Master Dayin,

03:42.840 --> 03:44.370
Thank you two for your help.

03:45.360 --> 03:47.200
Now, I'm all fine.

03:47.800 --> 03:48.760
Mr. Xiao,

03:49.000 --> 03:51.660
are you still feeling off
about your meridians?

03:56.960 --> 03:58.960
No, I don't think there's a problem.

03:59.200 --> 04:01.260
Master, maybe you can check my pulse.

04:15.960 --> 04:17.560
Congratulations, Mr. Xiao.

04:17.640 --> 04:18.760
Your meridians

04:18.880 --> 04:21.540
are even smoother and stronger
now than before.

04:21.640 --> 04:24.760
There is a powerful stream
of internal energy within you.

04:24.760 --> 04:27.040
You must've had many adventures

04:27.680 --> 04:29.810
after I gave you acupuncture therapy.

04:32.159 --> 04:33.290
Grand Master Dayin,

04:34.200 --> 04:37.680
actually, I got that energy
from the Infinite Pill.

04:39.960 --> 04:43.360
Surprisingly, after Shao Liulei forced me
to take that pill,

04:43.680 --> 04:46.120
I attained a surge of energy
that amounted to 60 years of practice.

04:46.120 --> 04:46.850
Big Brother,

04:47.080 --> 04:48.540
you ate the Infinite Pill?

04:49.040 --> 04:51.120
That explains why I was shocked
by your internal energy just now.

04:51.120 --> 04:52.840
What an incredible experience
you had, Big Brother.

04:52.840 --> 04:54.800
Where is Shao Liulei then?

05:04.320 --> 05:05.280
He is dead now.

05:09.320 --> 05:11.920
The Infinite Pill fell in
the hands of 3 people:

05:12.160 --> 05:15.520
Crazy Yan, Shao Liulei, and me.

05:16.120 --> 05:18.640
Not only has the Power Gang
been trying to claim it,

05:18.640 --> 05:20.100
but also Zhu the Great King

05:20.600 --> 05:23.560
has been looking for this pill.

05:23.880 --> 05:25.810
Zhu the Great King is involved too?

05:28.840 --> 05:30.920
It seems things are about to get chaotic.

05:30.920 --> 05:34.760
Wudang Sect and Shaolin Sect will see
the Power Gang as their arch enemy.

05:34.760 --> 05:36.960
In order to dominate the martial world,

05:37.520 --> 05:39.640
the Power Gang
will be even more unscrupulous.

05:39.640 --> 05:42.100
The Power Gang
has never stopped doing evil.

05:42.440 --> 05:45.400
I believe that one day,

05:46.200 --> 05:47.760
they will be eliminated

05:49.480 --> 05:51.640
by the righteous members
of the martial world.

05:51.640 --> 05:52.240
Qiushui,

05:52.920 --> 05:54.640
though you have
stronger internal energy now,

05:54.640 --> 05:56.200
you're not skilled in martial arts yet.

05:56.200 --> 05:58.440
You need to stay humble
and continue your sword practice.

05:58.440 --> 06:01.920
Just wait for the right time
to take revenge.

06:06.040 --> 06:07.370
Don't worry, Mr. Liang.

06:08.440 --> 06:10.100
That's what I'm thinking too.

06:11.800 --> 06:12.640
Mr. Xiao,

06:13.320 --> 06:14.800
you saved my life.

06:15.120 --> 06:16.440
Destiny has brought us together.

06:16.440 --> 06:18.320
I'd like to teach you

06:19.240 --> 06:20.200
the Energy Taming Technique,

06:20.200 --> 06:21.200
which I'm best at.

06:21.320 --> 06:23.840
If you regulate your breathing and power
with this technique,

06:23.840 --> 06:27.170
you'll become better at
controlling your internal energy.

06:52.320 --> 06:54.050
Thank you, Grand Master Dayin.

06:54.600 --> 06:55.280
Terrific.

06:55.560 --> 06:56.960
Now that Qiushui is back,

06:57.080 --> 06:59.000
let's have a celebration tonight.

06:59.000 --> 06:59.800
Mr. Liang,

07:00.680 --> 07:02.280
I appreciate your kindness.

07:02.600 --> 07:04.730
But there's no need for a celebration.

07:08.280 --> 07:09.680
I ended Kang Chuyu's life

07:11.040 --> 07:12.400
with my very own hands.

07:15.000 --> 07:15.680
Guys,

07:16.960 --> 07:18.880
we've finally avenged Tang Rou.

07:20.120 --> 07:20.800
Great.

07:21.520 --> 07:23.880
Tang Rou can finally
rest in peace, Big Brother.

07:23.880 --> 07:26.360
Finally, we took revenge for Tang Rou.

07:26.960 --> 07:29.490
I only regret
that I didn't get to help with it.

07:38.840 --> 07:39.440
Oh, right.

07:40.040 --> 07:42.000
I found this on Kang Chuyu.

07:42.960 --> 07:45.800
I suspect he was somehow
connected to the Power Gang.

07:45.800 --> 07:47.200
See what you can find out.

07:48.880 --> 07:50.409
Okay. We'll take care of it.

07:51.880 --> 07:52.740
Stay cautious.

07:56.000 --> 07:56.800
Mr. Xiao,

07:57.120 --> 07:59.800
something has been puzzling me.

08:00.200 --> 08:01.800
I had been to the Sword Manor.

08:02.200 --> 08:03.400
It was impenetrable.

08:03.440 --> 08:04.960
How did it end up being broken?

08:04.960 --> 08:06.290
What exactly happened?

08:06.680 --> 08:08.480
Has the truth been revealed yet?

08:09.240 --> 08:11.700
That day, we were besieged
by the Power Gang.

08:11.960 --> 08:13.890
With the solid Sword Manor's help,

08:14.000 --> 08:15.260
we could have held out.

08:15.880 --> 08:17.520
But the loyal Mr. Qiu

08:18.800 --> 08:20.400
suddenly turned against us.

08:22.040 --> 08:24.300
He poisoned the water sources in secret,

08:24.320 --> 08:26.560
so our water supply was cut off.

08:30.640 --> 08:32.100
Staying in the Sword Manor

08:33.280 --> 08:35.010
was equal to waiting for death.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.620
Given that, my parents

08:40.679 --> 08:44.760
chose to give
their chance of survival to us.

08:49.000 --> 08:50.260
This is what they said,

08:51.040 --> 08:51.680
"Son,

08:52.840 --> 08:55.160
get out of this place at all costs.

08:56.880 --> 08:58.810
Make sure you keep yourself safe."

09:04.520 --> 09:06.050
But by the time we returned,

09:09.000 --> 09:11.000
the Sword Manor had already fallen.

09:12.800 --> 09:14.800
I couldn't find my parents' bodies.

09:15.040 --> 09:16.920
Xueyu set up cenotaphs for them.

09:18.480 --> 09:20.960
I also find Mr. Qiu's betrayal odd.

09:21.960 --> 09:25.120
I once paid a visit to Xilou years ago.

09:25.680 --> 09:27.610
Mr. Qiu was the one who received me.

09:28.000 --> 09:30.000
He had no desire and was all alone.

09:30.680 --> 09:33.610
Neither did he have any family
to be threatened with.

09:34.000 --> 09:36.840
Why would he suddenly
switch to the Power Gang's side?

09:36.840 --> 09:38.080
It's said that the Power Gang

09:38.080 --> 09:40.340
owns an evil thing called the Misery Pill

09:40.560 --> 09:42.560
that plunges people into abject suffering.

09:42.560 --> 09:46.160
They use that to coerce the righteous
into betrayal and submission.

09:46.160 --> 09:48.000
That's what
makes the Power Gang invincible,

09:48.000 --> 09:50.060
and as influential as they are today.

09:51.600 --> 09:52.660
The Misery Pill...

09:53.200 --> 09:54.800
Betrayal and submission...

09:57.480 --> 09:58.120
Mr. Liang,

09:58.840 --> 09:59.970
Grand Master Dayin,

10:01.040 --> 10:02.840
after hearing what you two said,

10:03.000 --> 10:04.460
it suddenly occurred to me

10:05.880 --> 10:08.340
that Mr. Qiu might have been harmed
that way.

10:08.880 --> 10:09.720
How about

10:10.880 --> 10:12.240
we examine his body now?

10:13.040 --> 10:13.480
Okay.

10:15.160 --> 10:16.320
Beware of the toxins from the corpse.

10:16.320 --> 10:17.520
Hold your breath now.

10:34.360 --> 10:36.020
So the culprit was this thing.

10:37.280 --> 10:39.880
It's a Death Beetle
produced by the Ghost King.

10:41.880 --> 10:45.320
I bet the Misery Pill
is hidden inside this Death Beetle.

10:45.800 --> 10:46.600
You're right.

10:47.320 --> 10:49.440
This Death Beetle is a living creature.

10:49.440 --> 10:52.040
When it crawls into a person's body,
carrying the Misery Pill,

10:52.040 --> 10:54.500
the Power Gang
can badly torture this person

10:54.760 --> 10:57.120
by controlling the Death Beetle.

11:00.080 --> 11:02.540
So, whether this person
attempts to survive

11:02.560 --> 11:05.090
or to relieve himself
of agony through death,

11:06.280 --> 11:08.410
he's bound to be used by the Power Gang.

11:08.680 --> 11:10.410
I think all the righteous sects

11:10.960 --> 11:13.080
should assemble and unite immediately.

11:13.080 --> 11:16.200
Otherwise,
they'll be conquered one by one.

11:21.600 --> 11:24.360
The Power Gang use such beetles
to manipulate people.

11:24.360 --> 11:25.320
How horrifying.

11:27.160 --> 11:28.080
I can't imagine

11:29.200 --> 11:32.800
how many other people
will fall victims the same way.

11:35.440 --> 11:36.700
Don't worry, Qiushui.

11:37.200 --> 11:39.560
I'm with the Xiao family,
no matter what happens.

11:39.560 --> 11:42.690
Grand Master Dayin and I will help you
with all our might.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.540
Big Brother, don't worry.

11:45.320 --> 11:46.680
Liu Suifeng is backed by the Power Gang.

11:46.680 --> 11:49.880
And you're backed by us,
the Shenzhou Sworn Brotherhood.

11:50.240 --> 11:50.760
Good.

11:51.770 --> 11:55.810
[Virtues Always Prevail]

12:02.060 --> 12:06.900
[Energy Taming Technique]

12:10.820 --> 12:15.990
♪ Wishing to borrow
the body of a firefly ♪

12:16.490 --> 12:20.800
♪ To see the world,
to see all living beings ♪

12:21.670 --> 12:27.640
♪ Then borrow the wind and snow,
the bone-deep cold ♪

12:28.400 --> 12:33.140
♪ To bring a spring
free of chill next year ♪

12:34.530 --> 12:36.930
♪ If the long night is hard to pierce ♪

12:36.990 --> 12:39.740
♪ I banish all sorrows from my heart ♪

12:39.880 --> 12:44.710
♪ Only to end up like a falling leaf ♪

12:46.340 --> 12:48.740
♪ If the long night is hard to pierce ♪

12:48.770 --> 12:51.630
♪ Then tear open the darkness ♪

12:51.670 --> 12:57.000
♪ Hold a tiny flame, light a lone lamp ♪

12:57.520 --> 13:01.260
♪ Let my body be the chess piece,
entering this labyrinth ♪

13:01.770 --> 13:03.680
♪ Journey into the cage once more ♪

13:03.750 --> 13:05.560
♪ Hoping that
amid the dark wind and rain ♪

13:05.580 --> 13:09.350
♪ I can glimpse a sliver of sky ♪

13:09.380 --> 13:12.150
♪ Though the path be all frost and storm ♪

13:12.210 --> 13:15.310
♪ Though life may have no companion ♪

13:15.670 --> 13:21.010
♪ I have no regrets,
and the heart moves onward ♪

13:21.030 --> 13:24.600
♪ Why fear the ups and downs of life? ♪

13:24.730 --> 13:26.730
♪ Treat life and death as no big deal ♪

13:27.050 --> 13:30.590
♪ There might not be light ahead ♪

13:30.620 --> 13:32.620
♪ But my dream is a beacon ♪

13:32.670 --> 13:35.350
♪ I respect the short-lived insects ♪

13:35.550 --> 13:38.800
♪ I respect the ambitious insects ♪

13:38.960 --> 13:45.220
♪ Wait for the fog to disperse
and the sun to set ♪

13:46.440 --> 13:51.220
♪ Wishing to borrow
the body of a firefly ♪

13:48.160 --> 13:49.080
Third Young Master,

13:49.080 --> 13:52.200
the letters written to Miss Tang
have all been returned.

13:52.200 --> 13:57.220
♪ In exchange for warmth
in my palms and heart ♪

13:57.430 --> 14:00.120
[To Tang Rou]

14:00.230 --> 14:03.350
[Xiao Residence]

14:03.440 --> 14:08.030
[Huanhua Sect]

14:16.040 --> 14:16.640
Yiren.

14:17.000 --> 14:17.560
Xueyu.

14:18.280 --> 14:20.400
You've been working so hard lately.

14:21.400 --> 14:24.260
I made some nerve-soothing soup
specially for you.

14:25.120 --> 14:25.760
Thank you.

14:28.280 --> 14:29.400
It does cost a lot

14:30.360 --> 14:32.360
to rebuild Huanhua Sect.

14:32.880 --> 14:36.760
Renovating buildings,
reforging iron tools, regrouping forces...

14:37.640 --> 14:39.240
So many matters to attend to.

14:39.440 --> 14:40.960
You can't rush any of those.

14:40.960 --> 14:43.160
Over half of our savings
have been exhausted.

14:43.160 --> 14:46.200
Now, Kaiyan and I are
working our tails off to raise funds.

14:46.200 --> 14:48.160
But it's still hard
to bridge the financial gap.

14:48.160 --> 14:50.560
The sects
that used to be friendly with us in Jindu

14:50.560 --> 14:52.760
have all chosen to leave us in the lurch.

14:53.160 --> 14:54.800
I think we should pursue a different path

14:54.800 --> 14:56.530
to revitalize the Xiao family.

14:56.880 --> 14:58.600
As long as we make concerted efforts,

14:58.600 --> 15:00.460
I believe we will find a solution.

15:00.720 --> 15:01.280
Alright.

15:01.640 --> 15:04.100
Enough talk about these troubling matters.

15:04.200 --> 15:05.260
It's very late now.

15:05.600 --> 15:07.130
Why haven't you gone to bed?

15:08.800 --> 15:10.240
I tried to sleep,

15:10.840 --> 15:12.570
but then awakened from a dream.

15:13.640 --> 15:15.300
Was something bothering you?

15:15.760 --> 15:16.400
Yiren,

15:18.080 --> 15:21.320
do you know what I just dreamed about?

15:24.200 --> 15:27.640
I can't believe
I dreamed about my childhood.

15:29.120 --> 15:30.000
Back then,

15:30.560 --> 15:32.480
I was with my birth parents.

15:33.040 --> 15:34.760
In a spacious courtyard,

15:36.080 --> 15:37.940
I would fly kites with my brother.

15:39.720 --> 15:43.080
What a beautiful scene.

15:46.480 --> 15:47.160
Indeed.

15:48.400 --> 15:51.130
You parted with your birth parents
at a young age.

15:51.880 --> 15:53.940
But since you came to the Xiao family,

15:54.240 --> 15:56.370
we've all treated you as one of our own.

15:57.120 --> 15:57.840
Yes.

15:58.960 --> 16:01.820
I've felt warm and welcome
all the time since I came.

16:02.600 --> 16:05.440
Father, Mother, you, Kaiyan,

16:05.880 --> 16:06.840
and Qiushui...

16:08.200 --> 16:10.160
We've always spoken our thoughts
out loud to one another.

16:10.160 --> 16:11.290
What a happy family.

16:14.600 --> 16:17.730
However, since that misfortune
befell the Xiao family,

16:19.120 --> 16:20.980
everyone has become too anxious.

16:21.600 --> 16:22.240
You are,

16:22.440 --> 16:23.440
and so is Qiushui.

16:24.480 --> 16:25.400
But I believe,

16:26.080 --> 16:27.410
no matter what happens,

16:27.840 --> 16:29.520
the fact that we are family

16:29.800 --> 16:30.920
will never change.

16:31.600 --> 16:34.760
Our hearts should stick together.

16:37.360 --> 16:38.160
You're right.

16:40.880 --> 16:42.140
As the eldest brother,

16:42.960 --> 16:44.960
I didn't mean to lash out at Qiushui.

16:45.360 --> 16:47.680
By the time I reopened the family's door
that day,

16:47.680 --> 16:49.880
I had suffered enough
contempt and humiliation.

16:49.880 --> 16:50.880
But he had the gall

16:51.720 --> 16:54.780
to accuse me of cashing in past favors
to milk benefits.

16:57.120 --> 17:00.600
That day, he just spoke out of turn

17:00.920 --> 17:02.320
in the heat of the moment.

17:03.640 --> 17:04.160
Yiren,

17:04.560 --> 17:05.760
stop being mad at him.

17:05.880 --> 17:08.609
It's common
for family members to bicker, right?

17:08.720 --> 17:10.980
This is not an irreconcilable conflict.

17:11.720 --> 17:12.839
After some time,

17:13.040 --> 17:15.119
I'll invite Kaiyan and Qiushui

17:15.440 --> 17:16.770
for a meal with us, so...

17:16.800 --> 17:17.400
Enough.

17:20.520 --> 17:22.720
Our priority is to reopen Huanhua Sect.

17:23.200 --> 17:25.720
I'm currently reaching out
to the major sects

17:25.720 --> 17:27.680
and seeking assistance from afar.

17:27.880 --> 17:29.480
I don't have time for Qiushui.

17:29.480 --> 17:30.200
Besides,

17:31.240 --> 17:32.640
he's not a child anymore.

17:33.160 --> 17:35.800
It's time he thought about his future.

17:59.240 --> 18:00.640
The falconry whistle...

18:01.040 --> 18:02.170
The Death Beetle...

18:07.720 --> 18:08.760
The Power Gang...

18:10.520 --> 18:11.250
Big Brother!

18:13.120 --> 18:13.850
Big Brother.

18:15.040 --> 18:16.370
Something on your mind?

18:16.880 --> 18:17.920
Can't you tell?

18:18.560 --> 18:20.480
It's written all over Big Brother's face:

18:20.480 --> 18:22.240
"Tang Fang, why don't you talk to me?"

18:22.240 --> 18:24.080
"Tang Fang, are you still mad at me?"

18:24.080 --> 18:24.740
"Tang Fang,

18:24.880 --> 18:26.680
when will I get to see you again?"

18:27.800 --> 18:29.460
Can you stop saying nonsense?

18:29.640 --> 18:31.760
I just want to clear up
misunderstandings.

18:31.760 --> 18:32.360
Oh, right.

18:32.680 --> 18:34.760
How's the investigation
on the falconry whistle going?

18:34.760 --> 18:35.840
We're still looking into it.

18:35.840 --> 18:37.840
There will be findings in a few days.

18:41.080 --> 18:43.800
You brought only one jar of wine?

18:45.360 --> 18:47.160
This is premium wine.

18:47.520 --> 18:48.980
A jar of wine for the 3 of us.

18:49.280 --> 18:50.740
Big Brother, you go first.

18:52.240 --> 18:52.970
Sounds good.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.680
It's really nice. Your turn.

19:00.680 --> 19:01.340
I go second!

19:01.680 --> 19:03.010
Shouldn't it be my turn?

19:03.390 --> 19:10.430
[Huanhua Sect]

19:18.360 --> 19:20.760
I told them to come
and pay rent at 9:45 a.m.

19:21.000 --> 19:22.600
Now, it's already past noon.

19:22.800 --> 19:24.460
Yet none of them have shown up.

19:27.440 --> 19:29.840
Young Master, Tang Sect is holding
an ancestral worship ceremony today.

19:29.840 --> 19:30.960
All of those we invited

19:30.960 --> 19:32.360
have gone to Tang Sect for it.

19:32.360 --> 19:33.080
What?

19:33.800 --> 19:35.920
Tang Sect usually holds such a ceremony
in the middle of the month.

19:35.920 --> 19:38.400
Why did they choose
the beginning of the month this time?

19:38.400 --> 19:40.330
I can't believe they picked today.

19:41.080 --> 19:44.280
Tang Sect seized our land
and collided with our schedule.

19:44.760 --> 19:46.090
They keep provoking us.

19:46.920 --> 19:48.280
This is outrageous!

19:52.040 --> 19:53.640
Come on, cheers. Fill your glasses.

19:53.640 --> 19:55.960
Come sit down. Drink up.

20:02.600 --> 20:03.530
Hello, Mr. Xiao.

20:03.960 --> 20:05.290
We showed up uninvited,

20:05.560 --> 20:08.040
not knowing Tang Sect is having a ceremony

20:08.360 --> 20:09.160
today.

20:10.360 --> 20:11.280
Sorry for the intrusion.

20:11.280 --> 20:12.200
Don't say that.

20:13.440 --> 20:16.770
Many from the martial sects
have come to watch the ceremony.

20:17.600 --> 20:19.260
I shouldn't have negligently

20:19.320 --> 20:21.640
forgotten to send you two an invitation.

20:22.040 --> 20:22.840
My apologies.

20:24.920 --> 20:27.180
I raise my glass to you, Sect Leader Xiao.

20:33.480 --> 20:34.680
This is unnecessary.

20:36.240 --> 20:37.880
On this joyous occasion,

20:38.360 --> 20:40.020
I'd like to ask you a question.

20:40.480 --> 20:43.760
Usually, Tang Sect holds
such an ancestral worship ceremony

20:43.760 --> 20:45.560
on the fifteenth day of the month.

20:45.560 --> 20:48.080
What made you suddenly host one today?

20:49.400 --> 20:51.330
I just did what I was instructed to.

20:51.360 --> 20:52.720
How am I supposed to know

20:53.120 --> 20:54.480
why the elders made this decision?

20:54.480 --> 20:56.610
Tang Sect has always kept a low profile

20:56.720 --> 20:58.320
and seldom held gatherings.

20:58.720 --> 21:03.040
But now, you've invited so many guests
to this grand ancestral worship ceremony.

21:03.040 --> 21:04.960
Is it your master's idea?

21:05.320 --> 21:07.520
Or did he deliberately schedule for this

21:07.520 --> 21:08.780
to knowingly mess with

21:09.480 --> 21:11.140
our fund raising event today?

21:12.440 --> 21:14.040
Mr. Xiao, are you blaming me?

21:14.480 --> 21:17.140
I didn't know
you had plans to raise funds today.

21:17.200 --> 21:19.530
Suppose I did pick today for the ceremony,

21:20.160 --> 21:22.960
you wouldn't have the guts
to disrupt it, would you?

21:22.960 --> 21:23.360
You...

21:28.040 --> 21:28.720
Fine.

21:29.120 --> 21:30.850
The Xiao family will not forget

21:31.120 --> 21:32.780
Tang Sect's hostility today.

21:34.160 --> 21:34.840
By the way,

21:35.600 --> 21:37.680
since the Xiao family
can barely sustain itself now,

21:37.680 --> 21:39.940
all the disciples studying at your place

21:40.040 --> 21:42.370
will be taken over by Tang Sect
from now on.

21:42.760 --> 21:43.560
Boys!

21:47.080 --> 21:48.400
Uncle Xiao is leaving.

21:48.760 --> 21:50.820
Aren't you going to bid him farewell?

21:51.000 --> 21:52.920
Goodbye, Uncle Xiao.

21:54.560 --> 21:56.760
How dare you raid
our martial training hall?

21:56.760 --> 21:58.080
Ungrateful punks!

22:02.840 --> 22:05.300
We're not cutting ties
with the Xiao family!

22:21.320 --> 22:23.640
The Xiao family has fallen from grace.

22:24.200 --> 22:26.040
You can't even
make a few young trainees stay.

22:26.040 --> 22:28.400
All I can say is that times have changed.

22:28.760 --> 22:30.160
We've won over everyone.

22:30.440 --> 22:31.240
Xiao Yiren,

22:31.880 --> 22:34.340
trying to bluff
and intimidate others again

22:34.600 --> 22:36.840
will only turn you into a laughing stock.

22:36.840 --> 22:37.280
You...

22:37.280 --> 22:39.810
You can't even
make a few young trainees stay.

22:41.720 --> 22:42.840
What a disgrace!

22:43.840 --> 22:45.570
You're inviting humiliation!

22:48.720 --> 22:51.120
You've all used the land
of the Xiao family,

22:51.160 --> 22:53.040
and benefited
from the Xiao family's generosity.

22:53.040 --> 22:55.240
How could you turn on who has helped you?

22:55.320 --> 22:59.040
Now, these lands no longer
belong to the Xiao family.

22:59.640 --> 23:02.600
What's the point
of harping on the tiny favors

23:03.800 --> 23:04.960
you did us before?

23:05.400 --> 23:08.130
Butler Nangong,
I can't believe you're here too!

23:10.280 --> 23:12.140
Mr. Nangong is absolutely right.

23:12.440 --> 23:14.080
Now, the land
on which we train our members

23:14.080 --> 23:16.010
is leased from the Nangong family,

23:16.320 --> 23:18.960
and has nothing to do
with the Xiao family anymore.

23:18.960 --> 23:20.480
So now you have

23:21.560 --> 23:23.280
all the small plots of land I sold?

23:23.280 --> 23:24.080
That's right.

23:24.680 --> 23:28.680
Now, the Nangong family and Tang Sect
are two strong forces in alliance.

23:29.080 --> 23:30.960
From now all, all the affairs

23:31.600 --> 23:34.530
in the Jindu martial community
will be handled by us.

23:35.120 --> 23:38.960
It's time for the Xiao family,
which leads Huanhua Sect, to stop

23:39.440 --> 23:40.920
clinging to its past glory!

23:40.920 --> 23:42.240
-Yeah!
-Be realistic!

23:44.440 --> 23:45.200
Go away!

24:17.440 --> 24:19.300
Tang Sect and our family used to be

24:20.040 --> 24:22.040
two equally strong powers in Jindu.

24:22.280 --> 24:24.600
They already antagonized us at that time!

24:24.600 --> 24:26.960
Now, our family has
just come crushing down,

24:26.960 --> 24:28.880
they're already colluding with
the Nangong family

24:28.880 --> 24:30.160
to take our people and land away!

24:30.160 --> 24:31.720
Aren't they obviously trying to

24:31.720 --> 24:34.250
to devour our family's resources
all at once?

24:35.080 --> 24:37.280
Tang Sect's enmity is no surprise to me.

24:37.360 --> 24:39.560
I just didn't expect the Nangong family

24:39.680 --> 24:41.610
would discard our old friendship.

24:43.560 --> 24:45.220
Tang Song sure is detestable,

24:45.480 --> 24:47.680
but he did say something right just now.

24:47.720 --> 24:49.600
Times have changed.

24:50.440 --> 24:53.400
Back then, when the Nangong family
tried to gain a foothold in Jindu,

24:53.400 --> 24:55.080
they had to rely on us, the Xiao family.

24:55.080 --> 24:56.880
But today, we the Xiao family are

24:57.200 --> 24:58.800
in need of the Nangong family's help.

24:58.800 --> 25:00.400
However, the Nangong family

25:00.480 --> 25:02.880
has now allied with
the powerful Tang Sect.

25:04.560 --> 25:07.160
They'd just despise us even more,
wouldn't they?

25:07.160 --> 25:08.680
They both specialize in the same field.

25:08.680 --> 25:10.360
There is competition between them.

25:10.360 --> 25:10.960
Perhaps

25:11.880 --> 25:13.940
they're not as united as they appear.

25:14.080 --> 25:17.440
Besides, we go way back
with the Nangong family.

25:18.800 --> 25:21.240
If I drop my pride, cooperate with them,

25:21.760 --> 25:23.760
and help them achieve their ambitions,

25:23.760 --> 25:26.760
maybe they'll consider being our aide.

25:27.120 --> 25:29.040
It's time to take action. You go home now.

25:29.040 --> 25:30.170
Wait to hear from me.

25:42.130 --> 25:43.620
[Nangong Residence]

25:44.800 --> 25:46.120
How dare you disobey me!

25:46.120 --> 25:47.120
No more dodging!

25:47.120 --> 25:48.360
Kneel! On your knees!

25:48.840 --> 25:49.770
Trying to dodge?

25:50.040 --> 25:50.960
On your knees!

25:52.920 --> 25:53.850
I'll beat you up!

25:54.320 --> 25:55.040
Kneel!

25:58.040 --> 25:58.600
Dodging?

25:59.040 --> 25:59.720
Again?

26:00.240 --> 26:01.370
This will teach you!

26:03.880 --> 26:04.760
And you!

26:05.810 --> 26:07.470
[Nangong Wushang]

26:06.360 --> 26:07.360
Sect Leader Xiao.

26:11.200 --> 26:12.040
Mr. Nangong.

26:13.600 --> 26:15.360
Pardon me for being blunt.

26:15.720 --> 26:16.520
I came here

26:16.800 --> 26:18.160
with the hope of getting help

26:18.160 --> 26:20.440
from the Nangong family,

26:20.760 --> 26:23.080
for the sake of the friendship
between our two families,

26:23.080 --> 26:24.680
so I can revive Huanhua Sect.

26:25.080 --> 26:26.800
When the Xiao family returns to glory,

26:26.800 --> 26:28.840
I promise that in Jindu,

26:29.400 --> 26:30.930
he who knows the Xiao family

26:31.240 --> 26:33.560
will also know the Nangong family.

26:34.160 --> 26:35.620
How kind of you to say that.

26:35.880 --> 26:37.560
In the Xiao family, you're the only

26:37.560 --> 26:38.640
extraordinary martial fighter.

26:38.640 --> 26:40.400
By contrast, Tang Sect is flourishing

26:40.400 --> 26:41.920
and showing great momentum.

26:41.920 --> 26:44.680
Why should the Nangong family
ally with the Xiao family?

26:44.680 --> 26:46.800
It's true that Tang Sect is powerful now,

26:46.800 --> 26:48.960
but people's minds
change every now and then.

26:48.960 --> 26:52.160
Maybe their strength
will turn into a hinderance one day.

26:52.320 --> 26:54.850
Our two families
have been friends for years.

26:55.160 --> 26:57.420
Aren't we more reliable than outsiders?

26:58.040 --> 26:58.800
By that logic,

26:58.800 --> 27:01.130
the Nangong family is not exactly closely

27:01.400 --> 27:02.930
bound with the Xiao family.

27:04.120 --> 27:05.850
Mr. Xiao, how can you guarantee

27:06.680 --> 27:08.440
the Xiao family is reliable?

27:11.680 --> 27:12.810
Wushang's concerns

27:13.320 --> 27:14.650
are indeed reasonable.

27:15.080 --> 27:16.480
-Mr. Nangong.
-Brother.

27:17.560 --> 27:19.490
This is not an unsolvable problem.

27:21.240 --> 27:25.280
If the Xiao family
is genuinely sincere about this,

27:26.080 --> 27:28.320
I don't mind deepening the bond

27:29.120 --> 27:30.580
between our two families.

27:31.960 --> 27:32.880
Xiaoyi

27:33.160 --> 27:35.800
is even closer to the Xiao family
than to us.

27:37.400 --> 27:39.530
I suggest Xueyu marry into our family.

27:42.240 --> 27:43.160
Xueyu?

27:44.600 --> 27:45.280
No.

27:46.080 --> 27:48.000
Marriage is a lifelong commitment,

27:48.000 --> 27:50.400
which should be based on mutual affection.

27:50.400 --> 27:52.530
How can it be used as a bargaining chip?

27:52.680 --> 27:55.540
Then I don't think
the Xiao family is being sincere.

27:56.920 --> 27:58.720
How can you expect us to help you?

27:58.960 --> 28:00.160
But this shouldn't be

28:00.600 --> 28:02.660
my sister's responsibility, right?

28:03.320 --> 28:03.960
Fine.

28:04.800 --> 28:07.400
You'd hate to maintain the ties
through marriage, right?

28:07.400 --> 28:09.480
Then send the Xiao family's sword manual

28:09.480 --> 28:10.840
to the Nangong family.

28:11.000 --> 28:12.130
I'll keep it for you.

28:12.640 --> 28:14.880
Then, I'll lend you a helping hand.

28:16.440 --> 28:18.170
You mean Huanhua Sword Manual?

28:19.760 --> 28:20.320
No way!

28:20.760 --> 28:22.360
It's the treasure of the Xiao family,

28:22.360 --> 28:24.120
and the lifeblood of Huanhua Sect.

28:24.120 --> 28:25.440
How can I give it away?

28:25.800 --> 28:27.330
You refused every request.

28:29.680 --> 28:33.120
Do you want the Nangong family
to beg you instead?

28:39.880 --> 28:41.280
I came here to ask for help

28:41.320 --> 28:42.600
in good faith.

28:43.360 --> 28:46.680
Never did I expect the Nangong family
to be so aggressive.

28:47.000 --> 28:48.930
This conversation ends here then.

28:49.480 --> 28:50.740
Show yourself out now.

28:56.320 --> 28:57.000
Fine.

28:58.440 --> 28:59.200
Goodbye!

29:00.880 --> 29:02.410
Once you walk out that door,

29:02.760 --> 29:05.200
the Power Gang and Tang Sect
won't the only two institutes

29:05.200 --> 29:07.860
attempting to wipe the Xiao family
out of Jindu.

29:08.800 --> 29:11.330
The Nangong family
always gets what it wants.

29:11.520 --> 29:14.480
Thereafter, the Xiao family will no longer
have a place in the martial world.

29:14.480 --> 29:17.410
You're choosing to
ruin the century-old foundation

29:17.880 --> 29:19.720
of Huanhua Sect.

29:35.870 --> 29:37.850
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

29:37.870 --> 29:40.370
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

29:40.390 --> 29:43.990
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

29:44.080 --> 29:46.040
♪ Strive for the far shore
at journey's end ♪

29:46.060 --> 29:47.970
♪ Only when the long night
finally comes to an end ♪

29:47.990 --> 29:51.030
♪ Will this bow be not in vain ♪

29:51.380 --> 29:53.500
♪ Let the pouring rain drench me ♪

29:53.520 --> 29:55.240
♪ Let frost and snow embrace me too ♪

29:55.660 --> 29:59.230
♪ My lifelong sword intent
remains unchanged ♪

29:59.540 --> 30:01.260
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

30:01.290 --> 30:03.270
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

30:03.290 --> 30:10.190
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

30:15.370 --> 30:17.370
♪ The violent storms ♪

30:18.310 --> 30:21.030
♪ Thousands of turbid waves ♪

30:22.060 --> 30:23.970
♪ Tread on through till the break of day ♪

30:23.990 --> 30:26.840
♪ I'm ready to go with you ♪

30:26.870 --> 30:28.980
♪ Let the pouring rain drench me ♪

30:29.010 --> 30:30.720
♪ Let frost and snow embrace me too ♪

30:30.750 --> 30:34.220
♪ My lifelong sword intent
remains unchanged ♪

30:34.250 --> 30:35.970
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

30:35.990 --> 30:37.960
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

30:38.000 --> 30:44.900
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

30:46.240 --> 30:47.720
Although I've absorbed

30:47.720 --> 30:49.650
most of the Infinite Pill's power,

30:50.280 --> 30:52.140
coordinating my internal energy

30:52.840 --> 30:54.280
with sword techniques is still difficult.

30:54.280 --> 30:55.680
Your father specifically asked me

30:55.680 --> 30:57.560
to impart all the best techniques

30:57.560 --> 30:59.040
of the Xiao family to you.

30:59.560 --> 31:00.080
Mother,

31:00.800 --> 31:03.600
did Father tell you to teach me
Tianque Technique?

31:03.760 --> 31:06.800
It's fair to say
Tianque Technique is our family's

31:06.960 --> 31:08.820
most challenging skill to learn.

31:09.640 --> 31:12.170
Your father has only learned
the basics of it.

31:12.520 --> 31:14.000
Though every descendant of the Xiao family

31:14.000 --> 31:17.200
would memorize
the instructions of it in childhood,

31:18.400 --> 31:20.130
they can't start practicing it

31:20.360 --> 31:21.960
until the best timing comes.

31:23.000 --> 31:26.320
Channel energy from Lingquan acupoint
and direct it to Taiyuan acupoint.

31:26.320 --> 31:30.250
Clear the energy at Danzhong acupoint
and gather it at Geshu acupoint.

31:42.720 --> 31:43.780
What are you doing?

31:44.920 --> 31:47.240
Xueyu has never even
seen Nangong Wushang.

31:47.240 --> 31:48.920
That guy is incompetent
and overly ambitious.

31:48.920 --> 31:50.080
He can't make a good husband!

31:50.080 --> 31:50.560
Yiren,

31:51.040 --> 31:53.300
even if you are to
marry off Xueyu to a man,

31:53.520 --> 31:55.280
you should find a better guy than that.

31:55.280 --> 31:57.140
You think I'd like that to happen?

31:57.720 --> 31:59.080
They came on me strong.

31:59.680 --> 32:01.200
I meant to reject their proposal,

32:01.200 --> 32:02.800
but they escalated their acts

32:02.800 --> 32:04.960
and even asked for Huanhua Sword Manual.

32:04.960 --> 32:07.490
How could the Nangong family
be so aggresive?

32:07.560 --> 32:08.160
Yiren,

32:08.800 --> 32:10.880
we watched Xueyu grow up.

32:11.360 --> 32:12.690
Under no circumstances

32:13.800 --> 32:15.530
should we put her in hot waters.

32:18.960 --> 32:20.480
Given the current situation,

32:20.480 --> 32:23.520
the Xiao family only has
the Nangong family to rely on.

32:24.520 --> 32:25.840
They won't easily back off

32:25.840 --> 32:27.500
until they get what they want.

32:28.240 --> 32:30.880
They'll either be our in-laws or enemies.

32:31.360 --> 32:32.480
What else can I do?

32:34.360 --> 32:35.420
I'm only doing this

32:35.800 --> 32:37.960
for Huanhua Sect and the Xiao family!

32:42.170 --> 32:48.980
[Huanhua Sect]

32:49.120 --> 32:53.400
[Pattering Rain]

32:59.640 --> 33:02.200
I didn't know
you had plans to raise funds today.

33:02.200 --> 33:04.520
Suppose I did pick today for the ceremony,

33:04.520 --> 33:06.400
you wouldn't have the guts
to disrupt it, would you?

33:06.400 --> 33:08.000
Now, the land
on which we train our members

33:08.000 --> 33:09.840
is leased from the Nangong family,

33:09.840 --> 33:12.040
and has nothing to do
with the Xiao family anymore!

33:12.040 --> 33:14.160
The Nangong family
always gets what it wants.

33:14.160 --> 33:17.040
Thereafter, the Xiao family will no longer
have a place in the martial world.

33:17.040 --> 33:20.080
You're choosing to ruin
the century-old foundation

33:20.760 --> 33:22.320
of Huanhua Sect.

33:42.320 --> 33:42.920
Yiren,

33:44.040 --> 33:46.770
I know you're upset
and having an urge for drinks.

33:47.360 --> 33:48.890
But Huanhua Sect needs you.

33:49.240 --> 33:50.500
Why are you still here?

33:51.520 --> 33:52.650
Now, the Xiao family

33:52.960 --> 33:55.620
is not good enough
for the Nangong family, is it?

33:57.280 --> 33:59.600
You should quickly follow
your brother and father

33:59.600 --> 34:01.600
to seek a bright future in Tang Sect.

34:11.440 --> 34:12.370
I've heard about

34:13.120 --> 34:14.650
what happened in Tang Sect.

34:15.000 --> 34:16.929
It was the Nangong family's fault.

34:16.960 --> 34:18.889
We've failed your family's trust.

34:18.920 --> 34:20.850
I already wrote my family a letter,

34:20.880 --> 34:22.679
declaring to cut ties with them.

34:25.800 --> 34:26.440
What?

34:28.440 --> 34:28.920
You...

34:32.840 --> 34:34.570
There's a certain code of honor

34:34.800 --> 34:36.000
in the martial world.

34:36.520 --> 34:39.580
One can't take advantage of
those who are already down.

34:43.520 --> 34:44.120
Indeed.

34:45.239 --> 34:49.000
I did think of the code of honor
as the most important.

34:49.679 --> 34:53.000
But now, everyone has chosen
benefits and power

34:53.800 --> 34:55.080
over everything else.

34:58.120 --> 34:59.400
I, Xiao Yiren,

35:00.160 --> 35:02.820
swear to take back
what the Xiao family has lost,

35:03.800 --> 35:07.880
and to make those snobs regret.

35:45.880 --> 35:47.240
My Lady, bad news!

35:47.520 --> 35:49.780
The Nangong family has sent people here.

35:56.720 --> 35:57.440
Wushang.

35:58.120 --> 35:59.180
Don't call me that.

35:59.760 --> 36:01.880
Didn't you decide to sever ties with me?

36:01.880 --> 36:02.720
From today on,

36:03.160 --> 36:05.200
you are no longer
part of the Nangong family.

36:05.200 --> 36:07.840
You're not allowed to step foot
in Nangong Residence.

36:07.840 --> 36:08.760
Mr. Nangong,

36:09.080 --> 36:11.410
Xiaoyi has nothing to do with this matter.

36:18.560 --> 36:19.740
[Huanhua Sword Manual]

36:21.120 --> 36:22.380
Huanhua Sword Manual?

36:22.680 --> 36:23.160
You...

36:24.960 --> 36:27.360
It's your fault for being too incompetent.

36:27.640 --> 36:29.800
You even failed to
keep this important manual safe.

36:29.800 --> 36:32.000
Those young traitors of the Xiao family

36:32.440 --> 36:34.040
got hold of it effortlessly.

36:34.120 --> 36:35.600
How despicable of them

36:36.000 --> 36:37.480
to stab the Xiao family in the back.

36:37.480 --> 36:39.920
If Huanhua Sword Manual
reaches every corner,

36:39.920 --> 36:42.280
and the technique inside
is mastered by everyone,

36:42.280 --> 36:45.000
then Huanhua Sect
will be completely dispensable

36:45.000 --> 36:46.600
in the martial world, right?

36:47.320 --> 36:48.360
I don't know

36:49.200 --> 36:51.400
how you obtained Huanhua Sword Manual.

36:51.480 --> 36:53.200
But if you want to spread it around,

36:53.200 --> 36:54.280
then just do it.

36:54.760 --> 36:56.760
Now, you've come to stir up trouble.

36:57.320 --> 36:58.850
You must be up to something.

36:59.160 --> 37:02.240
How clever and lovely of you, Xueyu.

37:02.800 --> 37:04.480
Are you going to force Xueyu to marry you?

37:04.480 --> 37:06.010
What do you mean by "force"?

37:08.720 --> 37:10.240
I lost a little sister to the Xiao family,

37:10.240 --> 37:11.900
so they must give one back to me

37:12.360 --> 37:14.120
to compensate for our family's loss.

37:14.120 --> 37:15.000
Mr. Nangong,

37:15.640 --> 37:18.520
do you have to go to the extreme
on this matter?

37:18.920 --> 37:19.580
Xiao Yiren,

37:20.200 --> 37:21.460
I'll give you a chance.

37:21.680 --> 37:22.880
Marry off Xueyu to me,

37:22.960 --> 37:25.200
and this manual will be
her betrothal gift.

37:25.200 --> 37:26.660
Then, you can have it back.

37:27.080 --> 37:28.040
If you reject...

37:28.400 --> 37:29.280
And then what?

37:29.800 --> 37:31.600
You have 5 days to mull this over.

37:31.680 --> 37:33.480
If I don't get an answer in 5 days,

37:33.920 --> 37:35.720
the Nangong family will see to it

37:36.120 --> 37:39.600
that the Xiao family
disappears from Jindu.

37:40.080 --> 37:40.800
Wushang!

37:49.520 --> 37:52.170
[Liang Residence]

37:52.280 --> 37:54.600
[Teamwork]

38:06.400 --> 38:07.130
Big Brother,

38:07.440 --> 38:09.320
there's a finding about the item
you asked me to look into.

38:09.320 --> 38:11.120
Have you found out
the origin of that falconry whistle?

38:11.120 --> 38:12.320
We've got some leads.

38:12.560 --> 38:13.600
Also, we've found

38:13.600 --> 38:16.400
that the Power Gang
is investigating the same thing.

38:16.400 --> 38:18.240
We raided some dens in particular.

38:18.240 --> 38:20.280
After comparing those people's statements,

38:20.280 --> 38:21.200
we realized

38:21.480 --> 38:22.640
this falconry whistle probably came from

38:22.220 --> 38:23.800
[Investigate this item thoroughly]

38:23.000 --> 38:25.720
a mysterious organization
linking to the Northern Wasteland.

38:25.720 --> 38:27.800
A token from the Northern Wastelanders?

38:27.800 --> 38:28.400
Yes, it is.

38:28.840 --> 38:30.080
Besides, this organization

38:30.080 --> 38:31.880
has infiltrated the Power Gang.

38:32.120 --> 38:32.850
Two days ago,

38:33.240 --> 38:36.120
the Fire King of the Eight Kings
was executed by Liu Suifeng and his people

38:36.120 --> 38:37.160
for betraying the Power Gang

38:37.160 --> 38:38.560
and colluding with
the falconry whistle's owner.

38:38.560 --> 38:41.880
The Power Gang then demanded
a thorough investigation about this.

38:41.880 --> 38:44.640
This item was taken from Kang Chuyu.

38:45.320 --> 38:48.560
Kang Chuyu was the Sword King's confidant.

38:49.640 --> 38:50.920
Is Qu Hanshan

38:51.880 --> 38:53.940
working for the Northern Wasteland?

38:54.280 --> 38:57.210
But with Qu Hanshan's identity
having been exposed,

38:57.840 --> 39:00.100
he has long disappeared
from Guangling.

39:00.920 --> 39:01.920
As luck would have it,

39:01.920 --> 39:03.380
Qu Hanshan is in Jindu now.

39:04.440 --> 39:05.280
He's in Jindu?

39:06.000 --> 39:08.200
To catch the mole,
the chief of the Power Gang, Li Chenzhou,

39:08.200 --> 39:10.280
had Liu Suifeng play
a trick of self-injury.

39:10.280 --> 39:12.120
Unexpectedly,
the Sword King fell for it too.

39:12.120 --> 39:14.440
Qu Hanshan and Liu Suifeng
have never got along.

39:14.440 --> 39:15.720
With Liu Suifeng going down,

39:15.720 --> 39:17.080
Qu Hanshan thought he'd become

39:17.080 --> 39:17.880
the deputy chief.

39:17.880 --> 39:19.720
However, in the end,
he didn't get that satisfaction.

39:19.720 --> 39:21.320
He must be furious right now.

39:21.400 --> 39:22.400
Although we haven't

39:22.400 --> 39:23.960
located the Power Gang's headquarters,

39:23.960 --> 39:26.480
someone has revealed Qu Hanshan's address.

39:26.960 --> 39:29.220
He's living in the nearby Tongfu Street.

39:29.520 --> 39:33.040
Liu Suifeng and Qu Hanshan
have always been at odds.

39:33.600 --> 39:34.530
It's time we took

39:35.880 --> 39:38.080
advantage of the rivalry between them.

39:38.240 --> 39:38.970
Big Brother,

39:39.480 --> 39:40.960
suppose Qu Hanshan

39:41.160 --> 39:43.040
did collude with the Northern Wasteland,

39:43.040 --> 39:44.800
he must be feeling antsy now,

39:45.280 --> 39:47.880
as the Power Gang
is trying hard to catch moles.

39:47.960 --> 39:48.760
You're right.

39:57.320 --> 39:59.720
People make bad decisions in desperation.

39:59.920 --> 40:00.600
This time,

40:01.920 --> 40:03.440
I'm going to trick him.

40:13.600 --> 40:15.660
Take a look. High-quality products.

40:19.080 --> 40:20.480
Any different patterns?

40:20.920 --> 40:22.580
Just a sec. I'll show you some.

40:24.480 --> 40:25.540
How about this one?

40:28.760 --> 40:29.220
Master.

40:29.440 --> 40:30.840
Has Kang Chuyu come back?

40:32.640 --> 40:33.880
Where has he gone?

40:36.040 --> 40:38.570
The Sword King's mansion
is heavily guarded.

40:38.600 --> 40:40.260
I need to find a way to sneak in.

40:53.080 --> 40:55.760
This guy looks like Li Cai. How come?

41:17.440 --> 41:19.360
I'm sorry. I'm terribly sorry.
